= The Squad

A handful of insurgent freshmen clash openly with the Speaker. Social media amplifies everything. The press loves a civil war. Our opponents love it more.

- @unify: Hold a unity summit.
- @leadership: Back the leadership.
- @insurgents: Back the insurgents.

@unify
subtitle: Calming.
on-arrival: unity += 4; prog_dissent -= 3; mod_dissent -= 2; capital -= 1 if capital > 0

Nobody is pleased, but everyone is in the room.

@leadership
subtitle: Order.
on-arrival: estab_strength += 2; prog_dissent += 5; far_left += 1; unity += 1

The leadership prevails. The left grumbles.

@insurgents
subtitle: Disruptive.
on-arrival: prog_strength += 4; mod_dissent += 5; enthusiasm += 3; unity -= 3

Their influence grows. So does the friction.
